(text "USB_VBUS -> F1 -> VIN9 (fused, may be 5 V during negotiation).\nCH224A fixed 9 V via 6.8k CFG1; CFG2/3 and PG unused. DP/DM shorted locally.\nVHV1 and VBUS8 directly VIN9 per WCH table4-1 / section6.1; EP0 -> footprint11." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "d8837fa1-8acf-5fc2-bd12-30eade1de00d"))
(text "6.8k single-resistor configuration requests 9 V.\nCFG2/3 internal pullups; intentionally unused (no I2C header).\nPG intentionally NC: voltage window, not protocol status, permits power." (at 20.32 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "87f1bb91-d88d-5872-931d-35ed9a7b6265"))
